"Cela","464-468","En effet, l'usage du numérique est devenu, dans la vie professionnelle comme dans la vie hors travail, une pratique ordinaire. L’arrivée d’internet, des mails, des outils collaboratifs ou des logiciels de gestion a transformé certaines pratiques, métiers et l’organisation du travail.","179-463",45,"R totale pronominale","E reprise",?,"Flou",?,"oui",285.0,53.0,2.0,17.0,5.0,"demonstratif",?,"nsubj","ROOT","[5.88730001449585, -3.105600118637085, -2.164599895477295, 4.367499828338623, 4.414700031280518, 4.111299991607666, -0.7901800274848938, 2.6080000400543213, -2.1398000717163086, 0.5453799962997437, 1.3726999759674072, 1.1605000495910645, -1.492900013923645, -1.9205000400543213, 0.9393399953842163, -2.659600019454956, 2.093899965286255, 3.796799898147583, 2.735300064086914, 5.289299964904785, -5.307799816131592, 2.413800001144409, 0.9128400087356567, 2.924499988555908, -3.391400098800659, 0.8030499815940857, -2.8859000205993652, 3.7985000610351562, 1.8982000350952148, 1.9706000089645386, 0.23726999759674072, 0.778410017490387, -0.8555600047111511, -4.7789998054504395, 1.714900016784668, 1.3042000532150269, -1.3870999813079834, -2.6242001056671143, 0.13167999684810638, -3.3469998836517334, 2.255000114440918, -2.117000102996826, -3.762200117111206, -1.055799961090088, -2.4033000469207764, 1.9972000122070312, 0.18795999884605408, 2.9802000522613525, -0.9467499852180481, -4.060500144958496, 1.0684000253677368, -1.5210000276565552, -4.215000152587891, 0.5436300039291382, -2.670099973678589, -1.2041000127792358, -1.936400055885315, 0.623009979724884, 0.8024299740791321, -0.9976900219917297, 2.456700086593628, -1.6509000062942505, 4.593599796295166, 4.341300010681152, -2.0855000019073486, -0.5345600247383118, -2.9784998893737793, -1.0008000135421753, -5.200699806213379, 0.7659299969673157, -1.893399953842163, -1.455299973487854, -0.46393999457359314, -2.029400110244751, 3.0664000511169434, -2.7969000339508057, 1.5427000522613525, -0.6839100122451782, 1.189